From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Esme Povirk <esme@codeweavers.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Sep 2024 17:34:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] user32: Respond to OBJID_QUERYCLASSNAMEIDX in combo boxes.

This is a hack. We should implement RealGetWindowClass instead.

CW-Bug-Id: #24314
(cherry picked from commit c633c15dfa03907c5b46a221a91de8498d380a3b)
---
 dlls/user32/combo.c | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dlls/user32/combo.c b/dlls/user32/combo.c
index cb927341222..62b5e0467ab 100644
--- a/dlls/user32/combo.c
+++ b/dlls/user32/combo.c
@@ -1915,6 +1915,11 @@ LRESULT ComboWndProc_common( HWND hwnd, UINT message, WPARAM wParam, LPARAM lPar
                 return SendMessageW(lphc->owner, message, wParam, lParam);
             break;
 
+        case WM_GETOBJECT:
+            if ((LONG)lParam == OBJID_QUERYCLASSNAMEIDX)
+                return 0x10005;
+            break;
+
 	/* Combo messages */
 
 	case CB_ADDSTRING:
